hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1049","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mere waris deenar taqseem nahin karenge, jo main apne ghar walon ke kharch aur apne karkun ke kharch ke baad chhorun to woh sadqa hai.'"
"1050","[AI-translation] Sufyan se, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah se isi ma'na ki misl riwayat hai."
"1051","[AI-translation] Ibn Buraidah Aslami se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Main ne apni maa par ek ghulam sadqa kiya tha aur woh faut ho gai hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tera sadqa wajib ho gaya aur woh teri miras se tere liye hai.'"
"1052","[AI-translation] Mujhe mere chacha Muhammad bin Ali bin Shafi' ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abdullah bin Hasan bin Husain ne apne Nabi ke ghar walon mein se ek se zyada afrad se khabar di aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Ali, ke Fatimah (Raziyallahu anha) bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna maal Banu Hashim aur Banu Muttalib par sadqa kiya, aur Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un par sadqa taqseem kiya to un ke sath auron ko bhi shamil kiya."
"1053","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andar tashreef lae to main ne Aap ke qareeb roti aur ghar ka salan rakha, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main ne gosht ki handi nahin dekhi?' To unhon ne kaha: Woh cheez Barirah par sadqa ki gai thi. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh us ke liye sadqa hai aur hamare liye tohfa hai.'"
"1054","[AI-translation] Habib bin Abi Sabit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas tha ke un ke paas dehat ke rahne walon mein se ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Main ne apne bete ko ek oontni us ki zindagi tak hiba ki thi, aur us ne kasrat se oont jane. To Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Woh usi ki hai us ki zindagi mein aur maut ke baad bhi. Us ne kaha: Main ne use us par sadqa kar di thi. To unhon ne farmaya: Woh tum se zyada door ho gai."
"1055","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Najih se, Habib bin Abi Sabit se isi ki misl riwayat hai siwae is ke ke us ne bachche jane aur beqarar hue."
"1056","[AI-translation] Habib bin Abi Sabit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Umar ke paas the ke un ke paas ek dehati aaya aur kaha: Main ne apne ek bete ko ek oontni us ki zindagi tak ke liye di thi. Amr ne hadees mein kaha: Aur us ne kasrat se bachche jane, aur Ibn Abi Najih ne apni hadees mein kaha: Aur us ke bahut se bachche ho gae aur woh beqarar ho rahe hain. To unhon ne farmaya: Woh usi ki hai us ki zindagi mein aur maut ke baad bhi. Us ne kaha: Main ne to woh us par sadqa kar di thi. Farmaya: To phir woh tum se zyada door ho gai."
"1057","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir se riwayat hai ke un ke walid unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae aur kaha: Main ne apne is bete ko apna ek ghulam tohfe mein diya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne apne har bete ko is jaise diye hain?' To unhon ne kaha: Nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To use wapas le lo.' Abul Abbas ne kaha: Hamare tamam sathiyon ke nazdeek Malik hai, is liye main ne use shak ke sath bayan kiya hai."
"1058","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kisi tohfa dene wale ke liye halal nahin ke woh apne diye hue mein ruju' kare siwae walid ke apne bete se.'"
"1059","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri maa mere paas aain raghbat rakhte hue Quraish ke ahd mein, to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya main un se sila karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"1060","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne masjid ke darwaze ke paas sira' ka ek reshmi jubba dekha to kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kash aap ise khareed len aur juma ke din aur wafd ke aane par pahan liya karen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ise wahi pahanta hai jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas is mein se kayi jubbe aae to Aap ne Umar ko un mein se ek jubba diya. To Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne mujhe yeh pahnaya halanke Aap ne Utarid ke jubbe ke bare mein jo kaha tha woh kaha tha? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main ne tumhen yeh pahanne ke liye nahin diya.' To Umar ne use Makkah mein apne ek mushrik bhai ko pahna diya."
